  Description: "<size=28>Changes the spell\u2019s damage type to <b><color=#00ACD6>Water</color></b>,
    dealing <color=#ACB8E3><b>more damage</b></color> to <b><color=#ff6200>Fire</color></b>
    enemies and <color=#ACB8E3><b>less damage</b></color> to <color=#FFD619><b>Thunder</b></color>
    enemies.\r\n<size=26><i><color=#B8C7FE50>This rune may also alter the behavior
    of certain Impact Runes.</i>\r"
